BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the operation of a Zener Diode Shunt Voltage Regulator, deriving the range of source resistor Rs for regulation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Zener Diode Shunt Voltage Regulator Design:) Tj
T*
(   1. Circuit Configuration:) Tj
T*
(   - Unregulated DC input voltage Vin is applied through series current-limiting resistor Rs.) Tj
T*
(   - Zener diode \(breakdown voltage Vz\) is connected in parallel with variable load resistance RL.) Tj
T*
(   - Output voltage across load: Vout = Vz \(clamped constant\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Governing Current Equations:) Tj
T*
(   - Input current: Is = \(Vin - Vz\) / Rs.) Tj
T*
