(   - Input: Emitter; Output: Collector; Common: Base.) Tj
T*
(   - Input Impedance \(Rin\): Very Low \(~10 - 50 Ohms\).) Tj
T*
(   - Output Impedance \(Rout\): Very High \(~1 - 2 MOhms\).) Tj
T*
(   - Current Gain: alpha < 1.0 \(no current amplification\).) Tj
T*
(   - Voltage Gain: High \(~100 - 500\).) Tj
T*
(   - Phase Shift: 0 degrees \(non-inverting\).) Tj
T*
(   - Primary Applications: High-frequency RF amplifiers, impedance matching for low-Z sources.) Tj
T*
(   2. Common Emitter \(CE\):) Tj
T*
(   - Input: Base; Output: Collector; Common: Emitter.) Tj
T*
(   - Input Impedance \(Rin\): Medium \(~1 - 5 kOhms\).) Tj
T*
(   - Output Impedance \(Rout\): Medium-High \(~40 - 100 kOhms\).) Tj
T*
(   - Current Gain: beta High \(~50 - 300\).) Tj
T*
(   - Voltage Gain: High \(~100 - 500\).) Tj
T*
(   - Power Gain: Highest of all configurations.) Tj
T*
(   - Phase Shift: Strictly 180 degrees \(inverting\).) Tj
T*
(   - Primary Applications: General-purpose audio, RF, and digital switching amplifiers.) Tj
T*
(   3. Common Collector \(CC / Emitter Follower\):) Tj
T*
(   - Input: Base; Output: Emitter; Common: Collector.) Tj
T*
(   - Input Impedance \(Rin\): Very High \(~100 - 500 kOhms\).) Tj
T*
(   - Output Impedance \(Rout\): Very Low \(~10 - 50 Ohms\).) Tj
T*
(   - Current Gain: gamma = 1 + beta High.) Tj
T*
(   - Voltage Gain: Slightly less than unity \(~0.98 - 0.99\).) Tj
T*
(   - Phase Shift: 0 degrees \(in phase\).) Tj
T*
(   - Primary Applications: Buffer amplifier, impedance matching between high-Z stages and low-Z) Tj
T*
