12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: State and prove De Morgan's Theorems using truth tables and Boolean algebraic proofs.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   De Morgan's Theorems: Proof and Applications:) Tj
T*
(   1. De Morgan's First Theorem:) Tj
T*
(   - Statement: The complement of a logical sum \(OR\) is equal to the logical product \(AND\) of the) Tj
T*
(   complements:) Tj
T*
(   \(A + B\)' = A' . B'.) Tj
T*
(   - Proof via Truth Table:) Tj
T*
(   A | B | A+B | \(A+B\)' | A' | B' | A'.B') Tj
T*
(   0 | 0 | 0 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1) Tj
T*
(   0 | 1 | 1 | 0 | 1 | 0 | 0) Tj
T*
(   1 | 0 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 1 | 0) Tj
T*
(   1 | 1 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0) Tj
T*
(   The columns \(A+B\)' and A'.B' are identical for all input combinations. Q.E.D.) Tj
T*
ET

