(   [Problem Statement]: Design a Full Adder circuit using basic logic gates, deriving Sum and Carry expressions and truth tables.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Full Adder Combinational Logic Design:) Tj
T*
(   1. Operational Specification:) Tj
T*
(   - Computes the arithmetic sum of three 1-bit inputs: A \(Augend\), B \(Addend\), and Cin \(Carry-in) Tj
T*
(   from previous stage\).) Tj
T*
(   - Generates two 1-bit outputs: S \(Sum\) and Cout \(Carry-out\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Truth Table:) Tj
T*
(   A | B | Cin | Sum \(S\) | Cout) Tj
T*
(   0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0) Tj
T*
(   0 | 0 | 1 | 1 | 0) Tj
T*
(   0 | 1 | 0 | 1 | 0) Tj
T*
(   0 | 1 | 1 | 0 | 1) Tj
T*
(   1 | 0 | 0 | 1 | 0) Tj
T*
(   1 | 0 | 1 | 0 | 1) Tj
T*
(   1 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 1) Tj
T*
(   1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1) Tj
T*
(   3. Boolean Expression Derivation:) Tj
T*
(   - Sum Output S:) Tj
T*
(   S = Sum_m\(1, 2, 4, 7\) = A'B'Cin + A'BCin' + AB'Cin' + ABCin.) Tj
T*
(   S = Cin * \(A'B' + AB\) + Cin' * \(A'B + AB'\) = Cin * \(A ^ B\)' + Cin' * \(A ^ B\) = A ^ B ^ Cin.) Tj
T*
(   - Carry Output Cout:) Tj
T*
(   Cout = Sum_m\(3, 5, 6, 7\) = A'BCin + AB'Cin + ABCin' + ABCin.) Tj
T*
(   Cout = Cin * \(A'B + AB'\) + AB * \(Cin' + Cin\) = Cin * \(A ^ B\) + AB.) Tj
T*
(   4. Gate Implementation using Two Half Adders:) Tj
T*
