(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the Tunnel Diode: Energy band diagrams, negative differential resistance, and microwave oscillator applications.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Tunnel Diode \(Esaki Diode\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Physics and Ultra-Heavy Doping:) Tj
T*
(   - Degenerately doped on both P and N sides \(impurity concentration > 10^19 cm^-3\).) Tj
T*
(   - Fermi level EF lies inside the conduction band on N-side and inside valence band on P-side.) Tj
