T*
(   2-Bit Binary Magnitude Comparator Design:) Tj
T*
(   1. Specifications:) Tj
T*
(   - Inputs: Two 2-bit binary numbers A = A1 A0 and B = B1 B0.) Tj
T*
(   - Outputs: Three mutually exclusive binary flags: \(A > B\), \(A = B\), and \(A < B\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Equality Condition \(A = B\):) Tj
T*
(   - A equals B when A1 = B1 AND A0 = B0.) Tj
T*
(   - Equality of single bits is detected by XNOR gate:) Tj
